          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: மோதிரம்",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "மோதிரம் — mōtiram — \"a ring\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "மோதிரம் (mōtiram) is a loan from Sanskrit mudrā, \"seal, signet-ring\" (CDIAL 10203). CDIAL adds that the Sanskrit word itself probably came from Iranian."
            }
          ]
        },
